  "job_B8.4.3.2_20251003_114848": {
    "chunk_text": "; Nam petrum & \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6denes modor, & \u00fea \u00f0e mid him & hire hand nam & cw\u00e6\u00f0, thalimthacumi, \u00fe\u00e6t is on ure ge\u00feeode gereht, m\u00e6den \u00fee ic secge aris. & heo sona aras & eode; So\u00f0lice heo w\u00e6s twelf wintre, & ealle hi wundredon mycelre wundrunge. & he him \u00feearle bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hi hyt nanum men ne s\u00e6don & he het hire etan syllan. And \u00fea he \u00f0anon eode he ferde on his e\u00f0el, & him folgodon his leorningcnihtas. & gewordenum rested\u00e6ge he ongann on gesamnunge l\u00e6ran & manege gehyrdon & wundrodon on his Hu nys \u00feys se smi\u00f0 Marian sunu, Iacobes bro\u00f0or, & Iosepes, & Iude & Simonis; Hu ne synt his \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend, so\u00f0lice nis nan witega buton wur\u00f0scipe, buton on his e\u00f0ele & on his m\u00e6g\u00f0e, & And he ne mihte \u00fear \u00e6nig m\u00e6gen wyrcan, buton feawa untrume onasettum his handum he geh\u00e6lde. & he wundrode for heora ungeleafan; He \u00f0a l\u00e6rende \u00fea castel beferde. & him twelfe togeclypode, & agan hi sendan twam & twam, & him anweald sealde uncl\u00e6nra gasta. & him bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hi naht on wege ne namon buton gyrde ane, ne codd ne hlaf, ne feoh on heora Ac gesceode mid calcum & \u00fe\u00e6t hi mid twam tunecum gescrydde n\u00e6ron. And he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, swa hwylc hus swa ge inga\u00f0, wunia\u00f0 \u00fear o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge utgan. & swa hw",
